":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-10-12 09:07:18","date_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:07:18","modified":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/isohulk.conceptwebactueel-6.nl\/thank-you-message\/"},{"id":252,"type":"page","status":"publish","title":"Request a Quotation","slug":"request-a-quote","content":"<h1>Request a Quotation<\/h1><p>Need a price, bulk quantity, bespoke tape or private-label solution? Please tell us the product name, dimensions, quantity and delivery location. Our team can advise on availability and the next steps.<\/p><p><a href=\"\/contact\/\">Contact Tape Solutions<\/a><\/p>","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-10-12 09:07:18","date_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:07:18","modified":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/isohulk.conceptwebactueel-6.nl\/request-a-quote\/"},{"id":251,"type":"page","status":"publish","title":"Terms & Conditions","slug":"terms-and-conditions","content":"<h1>Terms & Conditions<\/h1><p>This website provides product information and quotations; it does not accept online orders or payments.<\/p><p>Please contact us for the terms applicable to your quotation or order. The final terms should be confirmed in writing before an order is placed. This notice does not replace any agreed terms or applicable legal rights.<\/p><p><a href=\"\/contact\/\">Contact Us<\/a><\/p>","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-10-12 09:07:18","date_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:07:18","modified":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/isohulk.conceptwebactueel-6.nl\/terms-and-conditions\/"},{"id":17,"type":"page","status":"publish","title":"Contact","slug":"contact","content":"<h1>Contact Tape Solutions<\/h1><p>Contact us for product information, custom requirements or quotations.<\/p><p><strong>Tape Solutions<\/strong><br>Hoofdweg 310<br>2908 LC Capelle aan den IJssel<br>The Netherlands<\/p><p>Chamber of Commerce: 65070186<br>VAT number: NL002196471B46<\/p><p><a href=\"\/request-a-quote\/\">Request a Quote<\/a><\/p>","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","date_gmt":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","modified":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/isohulk.conceptwebactueel-6.nl\/contact\/"},{"id":16,"type":"page","status":"publish","title":"About Us","slug":"about-us","content":"<h1>About Tape Solutions<\/h1><p>Tape Solutions specialises in adhesive tapes and packaging materials for industry, food and packaging, DIY and construction. We help professional customers source suitable products, packaging and custom solutions.<\/p><p>We value practical advice, clear communication and long-term customer relationships.<\/p><p><a href=\"\/contact\/\">Contact Us<\/a><\/p>","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","date_gmt":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","modified":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/isohulk.conceptwebactueel-6.nl\/about-us\/"},{"id":15,"type":"page","status":"publish","title":"Custom Solutions","slug":"custom-solutions","content":"<h1>Custom Solutions & Private Label<\/h1><p>Need a specialist size, bespoke material or private-label packaging? Tape Solutions supports product converting, custom specifications and packaging solutions for professional customers.<\/p><p>Tell us which product you need, the dimensions, quantities and intended application.<\/p><p><a href=\"\/request-a-quote\/\">Request a Quote<\/a><\/p>","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","date_gmt":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","modified":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/isohulk.conceptwebactueel-6.nl\/custom-solutions\/"},{"id":14,"type":"page","status":"publish","title":"Products","slug":"products","content":"<h1>All Products<\/h1><p>Browse our professional product range. Prices are displayed where confirmed; online purchasing is disabled. Contact us for a quotation, larger quantities or custom sizes.<\/p><p><a href=\"\/categories\/\">Browse by Category<\/a> \u00b7 <a href=\"\/request-a-quote\/\">Request a Quote<\/a><\/p>[products limit=\"40\" columns=\"4\" paginate=\"true\" orderby=\"title\" order=\"ASC\"]","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","date_gmt":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","modified":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/isohulk.conceptwebactueel-6.nl\/products\/"},{"id":13,"type":"page","status":"publish","title":"Home","slug":"home","content":"<h1>Professional Tapes & Packaging Materials<\/h1><p>Tape Solutions supplies specialist adhesive tapes, films and packaging materials for industrial, construction and packaging applications.<\/p><p>Explore our product catalogue, browse by category or contact us for advice, bespoke sizes and private-label solutions.<\/p><p><a href=\"\/products\/\">Explore Products<\/a> \u00b7 <a href=\"\/categories\/\">Browse Categories<\/a> \u00b7 <a href=\"\/request-a-quote\/\">Request a Quote<\/a><\/p>","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","date_gmt":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","modified":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/isohulk.conceptwebactueel-6.nl\/"},{"id":12,"type":"page","status":"publish","title":"Refund & Returns Policy","slug":"refund-returns-policy","content":"<h1>Refunds & Returns<\/h1><p>We do not accept direct orders or payments through this online catalogue.<\/p><p>For a return or refund relating to an existing order, please contact us and include the order reference, product details and reason for your enquiry. Any agreed terms and applicable legal rights remain in effect.<\/p><p>Return periods and refund arrangements are not confirmed on this page. Please request the applicable conditions before ordering.<\/p><p><a href=\"\/contact\/\">Contact Us<\/a><\/p>","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","date_gmt":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","modified":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-12 09:54:49","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/isohulk.conceptwebactueel-6.nl\/refund-returns-policy\/"},{"id":3,"type":"page","status":"publish","title":"Privacy Policy","slug":"privacy-policy","content":"<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: <\/strong>Our website address is: https:\/\/isohulk.conceptwebactueel-6.nl.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: <\/strong>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor&#8217;s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https:\/\/automattic.com\/privacy\/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: <\/strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: <\/strong>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select &quot;Remember Me&quot;, your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: <\/strong>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: <\/strong>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: <\/strong>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: <\/strong>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: <\/strong>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","date_gmt":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","modified":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","modified_gmt":"2026-10-10 13:22:17","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/isohulk.conceptwebactueel-6.nl\/privacy-policy\/"}],"page":1,"per_page":100,"total":13,"pages":1}},{"action":"theme.list","result":{"themes":[{"stylesheet":"hostinger-ai-theme","name":"Hostinger AI theme","version":"2.1.13","active":false,"template":"hostinger-ai-theme"},{"stylesheet":"tps-pack-wordpress-theme","name":"TPS Pack \u2014 Tape Solutions","version":"2.3.0","active":true,"template":"tps-pack-wordpress-theme"},{"stylesheet":"twentytwentyfive","name":"Twenty Twenty-Five","version":"1.5","active":false,"template":"twentytwentyfive"},{"stylesheet":"twentytwentyfour","name":"Twenty Twenty-Four","version":"1.6","active":false,"tem